 [l284090] (Switzerland)\r\n- [l284092] (Germany)\r\n- [l272140] (Netherlands)\r\n- and others (Belgium, France, Spain, Sweden...)\r\n\r\nIn the Netherlands, the label was run by [a892000]. In 1994 BMG acquired 50% of the Dutch affiliate, until 2001, when 75% of the operations were sold to [l141982]. In 2004. EMI acquired the remaining 25% and discontinued the label. After the collapse of EMI in 2012, the label was revived in 2013 by [l85494].","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:label:1608","relations":{"parentLabel":{"id":324172,"name":"8ball Music BV"},"sublabels":[{"id":1615755,"name":"Bärchis"},{"id":32353,"name":"Bunny Music"},{"id":90480,"name":"Crownhill"},{"id":4649358,"name":"De Grootste Hits Uit De Top 40 Van 1998"},{"id":4649340,"name":"De Grootste Hollandse Hits (2)"},{"id":177022,"name":"Dino"},{"id":1612821,"name":"DINO (9)"},{"id":335444,"name":"Dino Classics"},{"id":1293213,"name":"Dino Maxi Tops"},{"id":284090,"name":"Dino Music AG"},{"id":284091,"name":"Dino Music Ges.m.b.H."},{"id":284092,"name":"Dino Music GmbH"},{"id":299632,"name":"Dino Music Publishing"},{"id":2498539,"name":"Dino Music SARL"},{"id":2350006,"name":"Gouden Momenten"},{"id":3722514,"name":"Hollandse Hits Festival"},{"id":1889947,"name":"Idon Music"},{"id":40806,"name":"Ripe Records"},{"id":22959,"name":"RPC Entertainment"},{"id":63893,"name":"TWF Music"}]},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/label/1608-Dino-Music","type":"label","urls":["https://www.dinomusic.nl/","https://www.facebook.com/DinoMusicNL/","https://www.instagram.com/dinomusic_nl/","https://www.youtube.com/@DinoMusicTVChannel"]}},"/api/discogs/label/205491/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"205491","image":"https://i.discogs.com/NGXO_HEQHhFgVwTiXvg5k2eIBOKDKcS_p1EPuJIFmNU/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:212/w:507/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9MLTIwNTQ5/MS0xMjgxOTM2NjE1/LmpwZWc.jpeg","imageThumb":"https://i.discogs.com/EL3ID7W8i-SBmfJmJstLY17t-a_5SSu6YhlTpYmqe5w/rs:fit/g:sm/q:40/h:150/w:150/cz